                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.01/13: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Liberia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Reber</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-12-20T14:00:00-05:00">December 20, 1930—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>118. Your 178, December 19, 8 a.m. It is felt that the Department should not be
                    called upon officially to pass upon communications between the Liberian
                    Government and the Finance Corporation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
